UPDATE `publication_settings` SET `setting_value` = '<p><strong>Abstract</strong></p>, <p><em>The development of the tourism industry has a positive impact on the economy of the Balinese people, but it also has a negative impact on the environment. Green land is starting to decrease, even agricultural land has changed its function for the location of hotels, villas and residential buildings. Many villas were built ignoring predetermined government regulations. Construction business actors in Badung Regency are at least required to apply the Green Building concept. But in its implementation there are still many obstacles that are often encountered. Because of this, research was carried out in order to find out the level of conformity with the Regulation of the Minister of Public Works and Public Housing Number 21 of 2021 and the obstacles to implementing Green Buildings and overcoming these obstacles. The method used in this study was to use a questionnaire to find data distributed on 13 villa projects in Badung Regency, Bali Province with a total of 39 respondents. The results obtained are the implementation of Green Buildings in Badung Regency, Bali Province which has a percentage rate of 64.24% and is included in the Middle BGH category. assessment of green building criteria and Lack of outreach from the government regarding energy saving and the use of environmentally friendly materials.</em></p>, <p><strong><em>Keywords</em></strong><em>: Villa, Green Building, Environment</em></p>, <p> </p>, <p> </p>' WHERE `publication_id` = '409' AND `locale` = 'en_US' AND `setting_name` = 'abstract';
UPDATE `publication_settings` SET `setting_value` = '<h1><a name="_Toc140224163"></a>Abstrak</h1>, <p><em>Perkembangan industri pariwisata memberikan dampak positif terhadap perekonomian masyarakat Bali, selain itu juga memberikan dampak negatif terhadap lingkungan. Lahan hijau mulai berkurang, bahkan lahan pertanian beralih fungsi untuk lokasi hotel, vila dan bangunan perumahan. Banyak vila dibangun mengabaikan peraturan pemerintah yang telah ditentukan. Pelaku usaha konstruksi di Kabupaten Badung setidaknya wajib menerapkan konsep </em><em>Bangunan Gedung Hijau</em><em>. Namun dalam penerapannya </em><em>masih</em><em> banyak </em><em>kendala</em><em> yang </em><em>sering dihadapi</em><em>. </em><em> </em><em>Karena itu dilakukan penelitian </em><em>agar dapat</em><em> mengetahui tingkat</em> <em>kesesuaian  dengan </em><em>Peraturan Menteri Pekerjaan Umum</em> <em>dan Perumahan Rakyat Nomor 21 Tahun 2021 dan kendala penerapan </em><em>Bangunan gdung Hijau </em><em> serta penanggulangan kendala tersebut. Metode yang digunakan dalam </em><em>penelitian ini </em><em>adalah dengan </em><em>menggunakan</em><em> kuesioner untuk mencari data yang disebarkan pada 1</em><em>3</em><em> proyek </em><em>vila</em><em> di Kabupaten Badung</em><em>,Provinsi Bali</em><em> dengan total 3</em><em>9</em><em> responden. </em><em> </em><em>Hasil yang didapat yaitu penerapan </em><em>Bangunan Gedung Hijau </em><em> </em><em>di </em><em>Kabupaten Badung, </em><em>Provinsi </em><em>Bali memiliki tingkat </em><em>presentase sebesar</em><em>  </em><em>64,24% dan termasuk kategori BGH Madya, </em><em>Kendala utama dalam penerapannya adalah faktor </em><em>pemerintah</em><em> dan solusi adalah </em><em>perlu adanya sosialisasi dari pemerintah pusat atau pemerintah daerah mengenai pentingnya penerapan penilaian krireria bangunan gedung hijau dan </em><em>Kurangnya sosialisasi dari pemerintah mengenai penghematan energi dan penggunaan bahan yang ramah lingkungan</em><em>.</em></p>, <p><strong>Kata Kunci </strong>: Vila, Bangunan Gedung Hijau, Lingkungan</p>' WHERE `publication_id` = '409' AND `locale` = 'id_ID' AND `setting_name` = 'abstract';
