UPDATE `email_log` SET `body` = 'The following message is being delivered on behalf of ONLINE JURNAL PERMUKIMAN., ________________________________________________________________________, Yulinda Rosa:, Thank you for submitting the manuscript, "KEBUTUHAN TIPE HUNIAN BERDASARKAN PERTAMBAHAN UMUR DAN PERUBAHAN STATUS KELUARGA" to JURNAL PERMUKIMAN. With the online journal management system that we are using, you will be able to track its progress through the editorial process by logging in to the journal web site:, Manuscript URL: http://jurnalpermukiman.pu.go.id/index.php/JP/author/submission/6, Username: yrosa, If you have any questions, please contact me. Thank you for considering this journal as a venue for your work., Roosdharmawati, JURNAL PERMUKIMAN, ________________________________________________________________________, Redaksi Pelaksana, Jurnal Permukiman, http://localhost/backup/index.php/JP' WHERE `log_id` = '1';
UPDATE `email_log` SET `body` = 'The following message is being delivered on behalf of ONLINE JURNAL PERMUKIMAN., ________________________________________________________________________, Rindo Herdianto:, The submission, "Kebutuhan Tipe Hunian Berdasarkan Pertambahan Umur dan Perubahan Status Keluarga," to JURNAL PERMUKIMAN has been assigned to you to see through the editorial process in your role as Section Editor., Submission URL: http://jurnalpermukiman.pu.go.id/index.php/JP/sectionEditor/submissionReview/6, Username: ado, Thank you,, Prof (R). Andreas Wibowo, Pusperkim-PUPR, Phone 022 7798393, andreaswibowo1@yahoo.de, ________________________________________________________________________, Redaksi Pelaksana, Jurnal Permukiman, http://jurnalpermukiman.pu.go.id' WHERE `log_id` = '2';
UPDATE `email_log` SET `body` = 'The following message is being delivered on behalf of ONLINE JURNAL PERMUKIMAN., ________________________________________________________________________IG Nyoman Mindra Jaya:, I believe that you would serve as an excellent reviewer of the manuscript, "Kebutuhan Tipe Hunian Berdasarkan Pertambahan Umur dan Perubahan Status Keluarga," and I am asking that you consider undertaking this important task for us. The Review Guidelines for this journal are appended below, and the submission is attached to this email. Your review of the submission, along with your recommendation, should be emailed to me by 2016-10-12., Please indicate in a return email by 2016-09-21 whether you are able and willing to do the review., visit our website : http://jurnalpermukiman.pu.go.id, you have''n registered in our website;, visit: http://jurnalpermukiman.pu.go.id, your username  : mindra, your password   : stat80, Thank you for considering this request., Rindo Herdianto (Ado), jurnal@puskim.pu.go.id, Review Guidelines, •  Peer review anonim atau blind review, baik maupun penulis tidak saling mengetahui.,  , • Naskah akan direview oleh sampai 2-3 orang penelaah yang berasal dari dewan redaksi dan mitra bebestari setelah ditugaskan oleh editor.,  , • Kriteria penilaian meliputi kebenaran isi, derajat, derajat, orisinalitas, kejelasan uraian dan kesesuaian dengan sasaran jurnal. Editor berwenang mengembalikan naskah untuk direvisi dan menolaknya atas rekomendasi dari reviewer.,  , • Penelaah berhak memperbaiki naskah tanpa mengubah isi dan pengertiannya, serta akan berkonsultasi dahulu dengan penulis apabila dipandang perlu mengubah isi naskah. Penulis bertanggungjawab atas pandangan dan pendapatnya di dalam naskah., Pusat Litbang Perumahan dan Permukiman, Redaksi Pelaksana________________________________________________________________________, Redaksi Pelaksana, Jurnal Permukiman, http://jurnalpermukiman.pu.go.id' WHERE `log_id` = '3';
UPDATE `email_log` SET `body` = 'The following message is being delivered on behalf of ONLINE JURNAL PERMUKIMAN., ________________________________________________________________________, Rindo Herdianto:, I am able and willing to review the submission, "KEBUTUHAN TIPE HUNIAN BERDASARKAN PERTAMBAHAN UMUR DAN PERUBAHAN STATUS KELUARGA," for JURNAL PERMUKIMAN. Thank you for thinking of me, and I plan to have the review completed by its due date, 2016-10-12, if not before., IG Nyoman Mindra Jaya, ________________________________________________________________________, Redaksi Pelaksana, Jurnal Permukiman, http://jurnalpermukiman.pu.go.id' WHERE `log_id` = '4';
