UPDATE `email_log` SET `body` = 'The following message is being delivered on behalf of ONLINE JURNAL PERMUKIMAN., ________________________________________________________________________, Prof (R). Bambang Subiyanto:, I believe that you would serve as an excellent reviewer of the manuscript, "Karakteristik Beton dengan Menggunakan Berbagai Jenis Semen," and I am asking that you consider undertaking this important task for us. The submission is attached to this email. Your review of the submission, along with your recommendation, should be emailed to me by 2017-04-06., This is Seccond Round Review for this Article. And we Prepared to publish the next issue in Mei 2017., Please indicate in a return email by 2017-03-16 whether you are able and willing to do the review., Thank you for considering this request., Best Regards, Secretariat, Rindo Herdianto (Ado), jurnal@puskim.pu.go.id, ________________________________________________________________________, Redaksi Pelaksana, Jurnal Permukiman, http://jurnalpermukiman.pu.go.id' WHERE `log_id` = '38';
